<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;">Verify your email to finish signing up</h1>
    <p>Hi {{.OwnerName}},</p>
    <p>You started creating a Limen workspace called <strong>{{.TenantName}}</strong>. Confirm this email address to continue:</p>
    <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
      <a href="{{.VerifyURL}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 20px; background: #1f6feb; color: white; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none;">
        Verify email
      </a>
    </p>
    <p style="color: #57606a; font-size: 14px;">Or copy and paste this URL into your browser:</p>
    <p style="color: #57606a; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-all;">{{.VerifyURL}}</p>
    <p style="color: #57606a; font-size: 14px;">This link expires in {{.ExpiresIn}}. If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
  </body>
</html>
